      en: ["Largest industrial zone in Liechtenstein with over 4,000 jobs.", "Headquarters of the global corporation Hilti (founded 1941).", "Connection to the Feldkirch–Buchs railway line.", "Focus on medical technology (Ivoclar) and tool manufacturing.", "Use of an innovative district heating network for building heating.", "High export share of produced goods to over 120 countries."],
